===Etymology===
Comparing the Turkism {{m|ru|ча́лить|t=to bind, to moor}} this may be derived from {{bor|ru|ota|قنب|tr=kınnap|t=twine, cord}}, though the end consonant shift is {{unk|ru|title=unaccounted}}; maybe confused with the common Turkic {{m|ota|قنات|tr=kanat|t=wing}}. Alternatively, possibly {{bor+|ru|el|κανάτι|nocap=1}}, from {{der|ru|gkm|καννάτα}}.<ref>{{R:ru:Vasmer}}</ref>

